{"id":"aire","lemma":"aire","pos":"noun","rank":506,"glosses":["air (the substance constituting earth's atmosphere)","air (the open space above the ground)","air; wind"],"ipa":"/ˈaiɾe/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"aires"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-aire.wav","formAudio":{"aires":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/96/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Akhram-aires.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Me gusta el aire fresco.","en":"I like fresh air.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/68537","words":[null,null,{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"fresh"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"like, thumbs up"]]},{"text":"Un cambio de aires te hará mucho bien.","en":"A change of air will do you a lot of good.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/607957","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"change, shift"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"much"},{"g":"well"}]},{"text":"Deja entrar algo de aire fresco.","en":"Let in some fresh air.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461796","words":[{"g":"rest"},{"g":"to enter"},{"g":"something, anything"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"fresh"}]},{"text":"Sin aire estamos muertos.","en":"We would die without air.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/587491","words":[{"g":"without"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"dead","l":"muerto"}]},{"text":"Vamos a volar por los aires este lugar.","en":"We're going to blow this place up.","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to fly, to fly away"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"this"},{"g":"place"}]}]}